#: mason/vectorviewer/vectorviewer.mas:237
msgctxt "transformation.root.you_can_add_edit_or_remove_features_from_the_vector"
msgid "you can add, edit or remove features from the vector using the feature and restriction enzyme tables below the vector diagram. To remove an element, click on the \"delete\" button in the corresponding row. To edit an element, click on the \"edit\" button in the corresponding row. To add new feature elements, click on the \"Add Feature\" button below the table. To add a new restriction enzyme, click on the \"Add Restriction Enzyme\" button below the restriction enzyme table."
